[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m patterns, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mI want to focus on getting a 'tracer bullet' test ready where we can test a vertical slice of the game, including \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mnetworked connection, even if it is only one player connecting to the server to begin with.\u001b[39m                           \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m patterns, listed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory, ran \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'm scoping the row as a tracer bullet: one graphical client player\u001b[71Gconnecting\u001b[82Gto\u001b[85G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmanifest --serve\u001b[102G\u001b[39mand\u001b[106Gtrading\u001b[114Gthrough\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe\u001b[7Gscreens,\u001b[16Gwith\u001b[21Gan\u001b[24Gautomated\u001b[34Gend-to-end\u001b[45Gtest,\u001b[51Gand\u001b[55Gleaving\u001b[63Greconnects\u001b[74Gand\u001b[78Gpolish\u001b[85Gfor\u001b[89Glater.\u001b[96GNext\u001b[101GI'm\u001b[105Gchecking\u001b[114Gthe\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gtwo\u001b[8Gm\u001b[10Gke scripts th\u001b[24Gt\u001b[26Gthe test\u001b[35Gwou\u001b[39Gd combine.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m patterns, read \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m files, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mPlanning the tracer as one task, L52, put first in the queue.\u001b[65GI'm\u001b[69Gwriting\u001b[77Gthe\u001b[81Gplan\u001b[86Gin\u001b[89Gthe\u001b[93Gfree\u001b[98GManifest\u001b[107Glane,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmanifest.lane-c\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[