[0.066, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[1mOne decision blocks it:\u001b[22m on\u001b[30Ga server, today\u001b[46Gonly \u001b[52Gn administrator may provision\u001b[82Ga\u001b[84Gcompany,\u001b[93Gso\u001b[96Ga\u001b[98Gplayer's\u001b[107Gclient\u001b[114Gcan't\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bget\u001b[7Gstarted.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mRecommended:\u001b[22m a player\u001b[27Gmay provision their own\u001b[51Gcompany, once. The sta\u001b[74Gt screen then works \u001b[95Gn a server as \u001b[110Gt does\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  locally, and\u001b[18Gthe\u001b[22Gtest\u001b[27Gneeds\u001b[33Gno\u001b[36Gadministrator\u001b[50Gstep.\u001b[56GIt\u001b[59Gwould\u001b[65Gbe\u001b[68Ga\u001b[70Gnew\u001b[74Gdecision\u001b[83Gnext\u001b[88Gto\u001b[91GD-080.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mAlternative\u001b[18G\u001b[22mkeep it administrator-only. The test provisions\u001b[66Gt\u001b[70Gpl\u001b[73Gyer first, and\u001b[88Gthe \u001b[93Gtart screen tells players\u001b[119Gto\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bask the administrator.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BFor the implementation I'd\u001b[30Guse\u001b[34GOpus\u001b[39Gat\u001b[42Ghigh\u001b[47Geffort\u001b[54Gfor\u001b[58Gsteps\u001b[64G1–2,\u001b[69Gsince\u001b[75Gthey\u001b[80Gchange\u001b[87Ghow\u001b[91Grequests\u001b[100Gand\u001b[104Gsnapshots\u001b[114Greach\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe\u001b[7Gmodel.\u001b[14GSonnet\u001b[21Gis\u001b[24Gfine\u001b[29Gfor\u001b[33Gthe\u001b[37Gscript\u001b[44Gand\u001b[48Gthe\u001b[52Gdocuments.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTell me which prov\u001b[23Gioning rule you wan\u001b[43G, and whether to commit\u001b[67Gthe\u001b[71Gplan\u001b[76Gand\u001b[80Gmerge\u001b[86Git\u001b[89Ginto\u001b[94G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-base\u001b[39m.\u001b[108GNothing\u001b[116Gwas\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbuilt\u001b[9Gor\u001b[12Grun;\u001b[17Gthese\u001b[23Gare\u001b[27Gdocumentation\u001b[41Gchanges\u001b[49Gonly.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 3m 5s · done 9:35 am\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mSelf-provision once, commit and merge. All players will start with a company that they can name using the UI. The \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mtracer must at least put in the ability to name it using the console when the game starts.\u001b[39m                            \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ commit the plan and merge it\u001b[39m                                                              \r\u001b[2C\u001b[5B\u001b[49m\u001b[2mPress up to edit queued messages\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
