[0.116, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G  locally, and the test\u001b[27Gneeds no administrator step. It would be\u001b[68Ga new decision next to D-080.\u001b[98G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mAlternative:\u001b[18G\u001b[22mkeep\u001b[23Git\u001b[26Gadministrator-only.\u001b[46GThe\u001b[50Gtest\u001b[55Gprovisions\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gplayer\u001b[77Gfirst,\u001b[84Gand\u001b[88Gthe\u001b[92Gstart\u001b[98Gscreen\u001b[105Gtells\u001b[111Gplayers\u001b[119Gto\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gask the administr\u001b[23Gto\u001b[26G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BFor the implementation\u001b[26GI'd use Opus at high effort fo\u001b[57G steps 1–2, since they change how request\u001b[99G and snapshots r\u001b[116Gach\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe model. Son\u001b[18Get is fine\u001b[29Gfor\u001b[33Gthe\u001b[37Gscript\u001b[44Gand\u001b[48Gthe\u001b[52Gdocuments.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BTell m\u001b[11Gwhich provisioning\u001b[30Grule you\u001b[39Gwant, and whe\u001b[53Gher to commit the plan and\u001b[80Gmerge it into \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-base\u001b[39m. Nothing was\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbuilt or run; these are documentation changes only.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 3m 5s · done 9:35 am\u001b[35G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mSelf-provision once, commit and merge. All players will start with a company that they can name using the UI. The \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mtracer must at least put in the ability to name it using the console when the game starts.\u001b[39m                            \r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mcommit the plan and merge it\u001b[39m                                                                                      \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mSearching\u001b[13Gfor\u001b[17G\u001b[1m2\