[0.309, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G  at 77 s, the offscreen\u001b[28Gsmoke test\u001b[39Gat 38 s\u001b[47Gand\u001b[51Gthe reference\u001b[65Gframes at 32 s.\u001b[81GThe\u001b[85Gb\u001b[87Gilds took 20–30 s each,\u001b[111Gwarm.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mManifest's full gate\u001b[22m took about\u001b[37G17 minutes on\u001b[51G2026-11-27,\u001b[63Gfrom\u001b[68Gr\u001b[70Gughly\u001b[76G22:05 to 22:22. Tha\u001b[96G's much longer,\u001b[112Gand\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Balmost\u001b[12Gall\u001b[16Gof\u001b[19Git\u001b[22Gis\u001b[25Gthe\u001b[29Gsanitised\u001b[39Gsuites:\u001b[47Gtheir\u001b[53G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mctest\u001b[59G\u001b[39mtook\u001b[64G634\u001b[68Gs\u001b[70Gon\u001b[73Gtheir\u001b[79Gown.\u001b[84GThe\u001b[88GDebug,\u001b[95GRelease\u001b[103Gand\u001b[107Gno-TUI\u001b[114Gsuites\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gtook about 90–100 s each.\u001b[31G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mA lane's incremental build plus a few suites\u001b[22m should b\u001b[59G a minute or\u001b[72Gtwo. With four agents taking turns on the lock,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Geach will sometimes wait several minutes. A Manifest gate\u001b[63Gholding t\u001b[73Ge lock blocks the lanes for about 17 minutes.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSo the\u001b[10Gbatch's gates,\u001b[25Gone per\u001b[33Grepository,\u001b[45Gcome\u001b[50Gto\u001b[53Groughly\u001b[61G20–25\u001b[67Gminutes\u001b[75Gwith\u001b[80Gnothing\u001b[88Gelse\u001b[93Gbuilding.\u001b[103GManifest's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsanitised suites are the thing worth trimming if that's too slow.\u001b[69G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GWaiting for \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m background agents to finish\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mtrim the asan suites in Manifest's gate\u001b[39m                                                                               \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✻\u001b[3GDeterminin\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mg…\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent · ↓ to manage\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[18;3H\u001b[?25h"]
