[0.019, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6Glmost all of it is the sanitised\u001b[39Gsuites:\u001b[47Gtheir \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mctest\u001b[39m took 634 s on \u001b[74Gheir own. The Debug, Release\u001b[103Gand no-TUI suites\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gtook about 90–100 s each.\u001b[31G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mA lane's incremental build plus a few suites\u001b[22m should be a minute or two. With four ag\u001b[90Gnts taking tur\u001b[105Gs\u001b[107Gon the\u001b[114Glock,\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Beach\u001b[10Gwill sometime\u001b[25Gw\u001b[27Git several\u001b[38Gminutes.\u001b[47GA\u001b[49GManifest\u001b[58Ggate\u001b[63Gholding\u001b[71Gthe\u001b[75Glock\u001b[80Gblocks\u001b[87Gthe\u001b[91Glanes\u001b[97Gfor\u001b[101Gabout\u001b[107G17\u001b[110Gminutes.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSo the\u001b[10Gbatch's gates,\u001b[25Gone per repository, come to roughly 20–25 minu\u001b[72Ges\u001b[75Gwith\u001b[80Gnothing else building. Manifest's\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsanitised\u001b[13Gsuites\u001b[20Gare\u001b[24Gthe\u001b[28Gthing\u001b[34Gworth\u001b[40Gtrimming\u001b[49Gif\u001b[52Gthat's\u001b[59Gtoo\u001b[63Gslow.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GWaiting for \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m background agents to finish\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mtrim the asan suites in Manifest's gate\u001b[39m                                                                               \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[18;3H\u001b[?25h"]
