[0.244, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 115 \u001b[22m 3. `cl\u001b[19Gng-notui`: the same.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 116 \u001b[22m 4. `clang-releas\u001b[29G`: the same,\u001b[42Gunl\u001b[46Gss `--skip-\u001b[59Glease`.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 117 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m5. `clang-asan`: the same, with `--asan`.                                                             \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 117 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m5. `clang-asan`: the same, with `--asan`, less the long fixture loops. Its test preset leaves out     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 118 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   `fixture` and the `fixture_*` suites but `fixture_governance`: under the sanitisers each took 230  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 119 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   to 630 s (2026-11-27), the stage's whole length, repeating the code the shorter suites and         \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 120 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   `fixture_governance` already run sanitised. The other trees run them all.                          \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 121 \u001b[22m 6. clang-tidy ove\u001b[30G Manifest's own units in `cl\u001b[60Gg-d\u001b[64Gbug` (`scrip\u001b[77Gs/tidy.py`), wi\u001b[94G `--ti\u001b[101Gy`.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 122 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 123 \u001b[12G\u001b[22mTidy\u001b[17Gruns\u001b[22Glast,\u001b[28Gso\u001b[31Ga\u001b[33Gfinding\u001b[41Gfails\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51Ggate\u001b[56Gwithout\u001b[64Ghiding\u001b[71Gthe\u001b[75Gresults\u001b[83Gof\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Gstages\u001b[97Gbefore\u001b[104Git\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[39m Running \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m shell commands…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;