[0.565, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 115 \u001b[22m 3. `clang-notui`: the same.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 116 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m4.\u001b[15G`clang-release`:\u001b[32Gthe\u001b[36Gsame,\u001b[42Gunless\u001b[49G`--skip-release`.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 117 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m5. `clang-asan`: the same, with `--asan`.                                                             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 117 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m5. `clang-asan`: the same, with `--asan`, less the long fixture loops. Its test preset leaves out     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 118 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   `fixture` and the `fixture_*` suites but `fixture_governance`: under the sanitisers each took 230  \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 119 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   to 630 s (2026-11-27), the stage's whole length, repeating the code the shorter suites and         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 120 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   `fixture_governance` already run sanitised. The other trees run them all.                          \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m21\u001b[12G\u001b[22m6\u001b[15Gclang-tidy over Manifest's\u001b[42Gown\u001b[46Gunits\u001b[52Gin\u001b[55G`clang-debug`\u001b[69G(`scripts/tidy.py`),\u001b[90Gwith\u001b[95G`--tidy`.\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m22\u001b[12G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 123 \u001b[22m Tidy runs last, so a finding fails the gate without hiding the results of the stages before it\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m12\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mManifest's sanitised stage now leaves out th\u001b[75GIt's committed as \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m73a8289\u001b[39m and fast-forwarded\u001b[27;1H\u001b[18;3H\u001b[?25h"]
