[0.028, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe\u001b[7Gtrust\u001b[13Gboundary\u001b[22Gholds,\u001b[29Gso\u001b[32Gonly\u001b[37Gthe\u001b[41Gplayer's\u001b[50Gown\u001b[54Gtoken\u001b[60Gcan\u001b[64Gfound\u001b[70Ga\u001b[72Gcompany.\u001b[81GI'm\u001b[85Grebasing\u001b[94Gonto\u001b[99G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-base\u001b[112G\u001b[39mnext,\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gw\u001b[5Gich now\u001b[13Gincludes\u001b[22GL47'\u001b[27G snapshot, protocol and cons\u001b[56Gl\u001b[58G ch\u001b[63Gges.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRebased onto \u001b[1mfeature-base\u001b[22m, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe\u001b[7Grebase\u001b[14Gwas\u001b[18Gclean.\u001b[25GChecking\u001b[34Gthat\u001b[39Gthe\u001b[43Gcombination\u001b[55Gbuilds\u001b[62Gand\u001b[66Gits\u001b[70Goverlapping\u001b[82Gsuites\u001b[89Gpass\u001b[94Gbefore\u001b[101Gmerging.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[1B  ⎿  Found \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m new diagnostic issues in 1 file (ctrl+o to expand)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mEverything\u001b[14Gpasses\u001b[21Gon\u001b[24Gtop\u001b[28Gof\u001b[31GL47,\u001b[36G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mclient_serve\u001b[49G\u001b[39mincluded.\u001b[59GApplying\u001b[68Gthe\u001b[72Gqueue\u001b[78Gand\u001b[82Ghistory\u001b[90Gentries\u001b[98Gand\u001b[102Gmerging.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mWriting\u001b[11G~/projects/manifest.lane-b/docs/delivery-order.md\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Write(~/projects/manifest.lane-b/docs/delivery-order.md)\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✻\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;233;154;122mComputing…\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[19;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.261, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mions submitted as the welcome's actor, no fast-forward. A principal's token provisions its own company\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m once ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mD-122\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](../decision-ledger.md#d-122), `Command::Newcomers`), another's refused `NotAuthorised` \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mas it runs, a second `AlreadyProvisioned`. The client's console `found <company name>` founds the comp\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242many, locally or connected; `read <element>` logs what a screen holds. Connected, the saves refuse, the\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m fast-forward toggle is hidden and a closed connection's reason is in the status line, in four languag\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mes. `client_serve` (`client-serve.sh`): `manifest --serve` on a new trading world, the client offscree\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mn on lavapipe founds \"Ada Freight\", buys a tote and reads it held; after SIGINT and a restart a second\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m run reads it still held; `client_model` plays the slice over an in-process server; `company` and `rem\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mote` cover D-122. No hash pin moved. |                                                                \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 271 \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 272 \u001b[22m W01 i\u001b[18G technically\u001b[31Gindependent of N01–N03; its\u001b[59Glater placement is\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gdefault\u001b[90Gpriority,\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 273 \u001b[12G\u001b[22mnot\u001b[16Ga\u001b[18Gdependency\u001b[29Gon\u001b[32Gtransport.\u001b[43GLikewise,\u001b[53GW05,\u001b[58GW07\u001b[62Gand\u001b[66GW08\u001b[70Gcan\u001b[74Gbe\u001b[77Gdeveloped\u001b[87Gseparately\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[39m Searching for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern…\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✽\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;230;149;117mComputing…\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m30m 13s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m13.8k\u001b[33Gtokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[20C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;0;204;204m5\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[19;3H\u001b[?25h"]
