;248;248;242md one of a layer it meets; with no layers nothing changes, and no hash pin moved ([physics](physics.md#\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m    -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mlayers-and-groups), [AI](ai.md#steering)) |                                                            \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m  2 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mFree: parked on feature-base. J07 (picker, steering layers) merged 2026-11-28, awaiting the batch gate.\r\u001b[10C\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands…\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[20;3H\u001b[?25h"]
